{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"96e203d6","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.026363,"end_time":"2026-09-03T13:07:48.192011+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-03T13:07:48.165648+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["# TrackRAD A_003 — Pyramidal Observation-Layer + Enrichment Audit v2\n","\n","**Purpose:** resolve the A_003 real-motion observation failure before any cohort analysis, while\n","simultaneously verifying that DV / DA / DVA are genuine enriched state representations rather than\n","a disguised displacement-only implementation.\n","\n","The previous independent A_003 pilot showed:\n","\n","- real target displacement on test frames was on the order of 16–20 mm;\n","- the original single-scale reference-based Horn–Schunck field moved the reference target by only a\n","  small fraction of a millimetre;\n","- controlled A5 adaptation still behaved well, meaning the main unresolved failure was upstream in\n","  the image-to-displacement observation layer.\n","\n","This notebook therefore changes **only the optical-flow front end** using a coarse-to-fine\n","pyramidal Horn–Schunck scheme whose settings are selected on a synthetic known-translation\n","capture-range benchmark. A_003 target labels are **not used** to select pyramid settings.\n","\n","After settings are frozen, they are applied once to A_003 and the complete frozen A4/A5 pipeline is\n","rerun.\n","\n","---\n","\n","## Enrichment definition being audited\n","\n","The enriched snapshots are explicitly\n","\n","$\n","Z_t^{DV}\n","=\n","\\begin{bmatrix}\n","D_t\\\\\n","\\lambda_v \\dot D_t\n","\\end{bmatrix},\n","\\qquad\n","Z_t^{DA}\n","=\n","\\begin{bmatrix}\n","D_t\\\\\n","\\lambda_a \\ddot D_t\n","\\end{bmatrix},\n","$\n","\n","and\n","\n","$\n","\\boxed{\n","Z_t^{DVA}\n","=\n","\\begin{bmatrix}\n","D_t\\\\\n","\\lambda_v \\dot D_t\\\\\n","\\lambda_a \\ddot D_t\n","\\end{bmatrix}.\n","}\n","$\n","\n","The POD is fitted to the **entire augmented snapshot**, not only to $D_t$.\n","\n","If\n","\n","$\n","U^{DVA}\n","=\n","\\begin{bmatrix}\n","U_D\\\\\n","U_V\\\\\n","U_A\n","\\end{bmatrix},\n","$\n","the clinical displacement readout is intentionally\n","\n","$\n","\\boxed{\n","\\hat D_t=\\mu_D+U_D\\hat a_t.\n","}\n","$\n","\n","Using the displacement block for the final tracking readout is therefore **not** equivalent to\n","fitting displacement-only POD. It is the correct readout from the enriched latent coefficients.\n","\n","The audit below checks this numerically by testing:\n","\n","1. $\\dot D$ and $\\ddot D$ are nonzero causal derivatives;\n","2. weighted derivative blocks have the intended fit-scale balancing;\n","3. enriched feature dimensions are genuinely larger than displacement-only;\n","4. enriched displacement readout blocks $U_D$ differ from the displacement-only POD subspace;\n","5. the explicit block formula reproduces the implementation's reconstructed displacement exactly;\n","6. enriched displacement reconstructions actually differ from the D-only reconstruction;\n","7. whether those implementation differences translate into a meaningful tracking benefit.\n","\n","This separates two very different conclusions:\n","\n","> **implemented correctly but no benefit**\n","\n","from\n","\n","> **the code is effectively still displacement-only**."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"def42e9d","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.019227,"end_time":"2026-09-03T13:07:48.229924+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-03T13:07:48.210697+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 0. Install/import dependencies"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":1,"id":"fa3dfbeb","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-09-03T13:07:48.269559Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-09-03T13:07:48.268881Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-09-03T13:07:54.582744Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-09-03T13:07:54.581792Z"},"papermill":{"duration":6.335571,"end_time":"2026-09-03T13:07:54.584579+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026